@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = "Privacy policy for Matt Zanco’s personal hire site: no tracking cookies, minimal data, contact via email.";
}

<div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center about-page">
    <div class="business-card p-4 p-md-5 w-100 text-start" style="max-width: 640px;">
        <h1 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Privacy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Last updated @DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("MMMM yyyy")</p>

        <p>This site is a personal portfolio for <strong>Matt Zanco</strong>. The goal is to share professional background and make it easy for employers and collaborators to reach out.</p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">What we collect</h2>
        <p>This static-style site does not use advertising or analytics cookies. Standard web hosting may log requests (for example IP address, user agent, and timestamp) as part of normal server or platform operations — that processing is governed by your hosting provider’s policies.</p>
        <p>If you email me or message via LinkedIn or GitHub, you share whatever information you include in that message, under those services’ terms.</p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">How your information is used</h2>
        <p>Contact details you send are used only to respond to professional inquiries. I do not sell personal data.</p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Your choices</h2>
        <p>You may request correction or deletion of correspondence you’ve sent, subject to reasonable limits (for example if I need to retain something for legal or business records).</p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:mattzanco@gmail.com?subject=Privacy%20question">mattzanco@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        <p class="mb-0"><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">← Back to home</a></p>
    </div>
</div>
